{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00489","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 三 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝临中坛，受厘元神。\n皇灵萃止，羽旄肃陈。\n摄提运衡，招摇移轮。\n光光宇宙，电耀雷震。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}